      "text": {
        "hi": "आज के 10 नए शब्द: पैसा और ख़रीदारी। हर शब्द सुनो, समझो और बोलो।",
        "hinglish": "Aaj ke 10 naye shabd: Paisa aur khareedaari. Har shabd suno, samjho aur bolo.",
        "en": "Ten new words today: Money and shopping. Listen, understand and say each one."
      }
    },
