      },
      "meaning": "to keep money to use later",
      "example": "I save a coin every day.",
      "exampleMeaning": {
        "hi": "मैं रोज़ एक सिक्का बचाता/बचाती हूँ।",
        "hinglish": "Main roz ek sikka bachaata/bachaati hoon."
      }
    },
