      },
      "meaning": "to use money to buy things",
      "example": "Do not spend all your money on sweets.",
      "exampleMeaning": {
        "hi": "अपने सारे पैसे मिठाई पर ख़र्च मत करो।",
        "hinglish": "Apne saare paise mithaai par kharch mat karo."
      }
    },
